; The one error-handling import the CRT's float helper asks for.
;
; `LIBCMT.lib(helpexcept.obj)` is pulled in by the encoder's exception helper and
; raises through `RaiseException`. Naming the API set here instead of the desktop
; kernel is the whole point of the file: `WhatsAppNative.dll` imports the same
; function from the same module on the same phone.
LIBRARY api-ms-win-core-errorhandling-l1-1-1.dll

EXPORTS
    RaiseException
